WEBVTT

00:00:03.084 --> 00:00:04.164
Aunt Petunia:
UP. GET UP.

00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:06.558
[KNOCKING]

00:00:06.602 --> 00:00:08.778
[SIGHS] NOW!

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.390
[DOOR SLAMS]

00:00:22.966 --> 00:00:26.448
Dudley: WAKE UP, COUSIN!
WE'RE GOING TO THE ZOO!

00:00:26.491 --> 00:00:29.146
[STOMPING]

00:00:30.147 --> 00:00:33.281
HA HA HA HA!

00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:41.463
Petunia: OH, HERE HE COMES,
THE BIRTHDAY BOY!

00:00:41.506 --> 00:00:42.899
Vernon:
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, SON.

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:44.553
[GIGGLING]

00:00:44.596 --> 00:00:46.468
WHY DON'T YOU JUST
COOK THE BREAKFAST

00:00:46.511 --> 00:00:47.904
AND TRY NOT
TO BURN ANYTHING?

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:49.035
YES, AUNT PETUNIA.

00:00:49.079 --> 00:00:52.735
I WANT EVERYTHING
TO BE PERFECT

00:00:52.778 --> 00:00:56.216
FOR MY DUDLEY'S
SPECIAL DAY!

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:57.740
Vernon: HURRY UP!

00:00:57.783 --> 00:00:59.002
BRING MY COFFEE, BOY!

00:00:59.045 --> 00:01:00.003
YES, UNCLE VERNON.

00:01:00.046 --> 00:01:01.787
Petunia: OHH!

00:01:01.831 --> 00:01:04.660
AREN'T THEY WONDERFUL,
DARLING?

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:09.142
HOW MANY ARE THERE?

00:01:09.186 --> 00:01:11.014
36. COUNTED THEM MYSELF.

00:01:11.057 --> 00:01:14.800
36?! BUT LAST YEAR--
LAST YEAR I HAD 37!

00:01:14.844 --> 00:01:16.324
YES, WELL,
SOME OF THEM

00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:17.673
ARE QUITE A BIT BIGGER
THAN LAST YEAR'S.

00:01:17.716 --> 00:01:19.239
I DON'T CARE
HOW BIG THEY ARE!

00:01:19.283 --> 00:01:20.980
OH, NOW, NOW, NOW, THIS IS
WHAT WE'RE GOING TO DO,

00:01:21.024 --> 00:01:22.373
IS THAT WHEN WE GO OUT

00:01:22.417 --> 00:01:24.375
WE'RE GOING TO BUY YOU
2 NEW PRESENTS.

00:01:24.419 --> 00:01:26.203
HOW'S THAT, PUMPKIN?

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.903
THIS WILL BE
A LOVELY DAY AT THE ZOO.

00:01:30.947 --> 00:01:33.297
I'M REALLY LOOKING
FORWARD TO IT.

00:01:36.735 --> 00:01:38.998
I'M WARNING YOU NOW, BOY.

00:01:39.042 --> 00:01:42.654
ANY FUNNY BUSINESS,
ANY AT ALL,

00:01:42.698 --> 00:01:46.179
AND YOU WON'T HAVE
ANY MEALS FOR A WEEK.

00:01:46.223 --> 00:01:48.443
GET IN.

00:01:48.486 --> 00:01:50.488
[CHILDREN TALKING]

00:01:55.232 --> 00:01:57.147
Dudley: MAKE IT MOVE!

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:01.543
[BANGING]
MOVE!

00:02:01.586 --> 00:02:03.283
MOVE!

00:02:03.327 --> 00:02:04.807
HE'S ASLEEP!

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:07.157
HE'S BORING.

00:02:09.942 --> 00:02:11.422
SORRY ABOUT HIM.

00:02:11.466 --> 00:02:13.250
HE DOESN'T UNDERSTAND
WHAT IT'S LIKE,

00:02:13.293 --> 00:02:15.687
LYING THERE
DAY AFTER DAY,

00:02:15.731 --> 00:02:19.299
WATCHING PEOPLE PRESS
THEIR UGLY FACES IN ON YOU.

00:02:22.346 --> 00:02:24.217
CAN YOU HEAR ME?

00:02:27.482 --> 00:02:32.008
IT'S JUST...I'VE NEVER
TALKED TO A SNAKE BEFORE.

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:35.141
DO YOU...I MEAN...

00:02:35.185 --> 00:02:37.230
DO YOU TALK
TO PEOPLE OFTEN?

00:02:39.189 --> 00:02:40.930
YOU'RE FROM BURMA,
AREN'T YOU?

00:02:40.973 --> 00:02:42.453
WAS IT NICE THERE?

00:02:42.497 --> 00:02:43.889
DO YOU MISS YOUR FAMILY?

00:02:47.589 --> 00:02:50.983
I SEE.
THAT'S ME AS WELL.

00:02:51.027 --> 00:02:52.768
I NEVER KNEW
MY PARENTS, EITHER.

00:02:52.811 --> 00:02:54.552
MUMMY, DAD, COME HERE!

00:02:54.596 --> 00:02:56.511
YOU WON'T BELIEVE WHAT
THIS SNAKE IS DOING!

00:03:00.906 --> 00:03:02.734
WHOA! AAH!

00:03:02.778 --> 00:03:04.693
AAH!

00:03:05.911 --> 00:03:07.913
[SPUTTERING]

00:03:20.535 --> 00:03:23.146
THANKS-S-S.

00:03:23.189 --> 00:03:24.800
ANYTIME.

00:03:27.716 --> 00:03:28.847
Man: SNAKE!

00:03:28.891 --> 00:03:29.848
[HISSES]

00:03:29.892 --> 00:03:31.763
[SCREAMING]

00:03:45.342 --> 00:03:46.299
MUM! MUMMY!

00:03:46.343 --> 00:03:47.518
AAH!

00:03:47.562 --> 00:03:48.780
MUM, HELP ME!
HELP ME!

00:03:48.824 --> 00:03:50.565
MY DARLING BOY!

00:03:50.608 --> 00:03:52.131
HOW DID YOU
GET IN THERE?

00:03:52.175 --> 00:03:53.481
[GIGGLING]

00:03:53.524 --> 00:03:56.701
HOW DID YOU
GET IN THERE?

00:03:56.745 --> 00:03:58.355
[DUDLEY CRYING]

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:03.621
IT'S ALL RIGHT,
SWEETHEART.

00:04:03.665 --> 00:04:05.057
IT'S ALL RIGHT.

00:04:05.101 --> 00:04:07.582
WE'LL GET YOU OUT OF THESE
TERRIBLY COLD CLOTHES.

00:04:09.192 --> 00:04:10.715
OW!
WHAT HAPPENED?

00:04:10.759 --> 00:04:12.848
I SWEAR, I DON'T KNOW!GRR!

00:04:12.891 --> 00:04:14.153
ONE MINUTE,
THE GLASS WAS THERE,

00:04:14.197 --> 00:04:15.981
AND THEN IT WAS GONE!
IT WAS LIKE MAGIC!

00:04:16.025 --> 00:04:17.766
[SCOFFS]

00:04:20.551 --> 00:04:23.859
THERE'S NO SUCH THING
AS MAGIC!

00:04:23.902 --> 00:04:25.513
[SLAM]

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:31.388
[SCREECH]

00:05:00.678 --> 00:05:03.376
Vernon: OH, MARGE IS ILL.
ATE A FUNNY WHELK.

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:04.385
DAD, LOOK,
HARRY'S GOT A LETTER!

